From 02c2d10899a181f52f81028e6f5c3e8351f72e29 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: iimmyy <i.a.martins001@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 12:19:58 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 42/48] hexagon Q4_0 several-column path: a short last group
 computes only its real columns (variants for 1-4 columns of one
 always-inlined tile helper) instead of padding to 4 with repeats of the last
 column. Board v68, 4096x14336: 2 columns 3.51 -> 2.20 ms, 3 columns 3.73 ->
 3.08 ms, 5 columns 7.21 -> 5.60 ms; 1 and 4 unchanged. Word odds on the real
 brain identical to before at batch sizes 5/6/7 (KL 0, same top 100%, the same
 max as the old engine against itself)

---
 ggml/src/ggml-hexagon/htp/lg-q2k-ops.c | 101 ++++++++++++++-----------
 1 file changed, 55 insertions(+), 46 deletions(-)

diff --git a/ggml/src/ggml-hexagon/htp/lg-q2k-ops.c b/ggml/src/ggml-hexagon/htp/lg-q2k-ops.c
index eddd38b..e6a9caf 100644
